{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/ai/send-context-webhook","title":"Send application context to AI","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"send-application-context-to-ai","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Send application context to AI"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"provideSendContextToAi"},{"t":"text","text":" adds a developer-oriented context inspector to a Craft"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"application. It is useful when an AI assistant needs more than a copied error"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"message: the selected component, the recent user journey, the relevant app"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"state, and optionally the DOM and computed CSS."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Typical uses include:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"asking an AI assistant to explain or fix a broken screen;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"preparing a reproducible bug report or a support ticket;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"investigating a failed HTTP request, navigation, mutation, or query;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"sending a consistent, structured context to an internal debugging agent."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The feature is user-driven. It does not call an AI service by itself. Without"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"an "},{"t":"code","text":"endpoint"},{"t":"text","text":", everything stays in the browser and the user copies the prompt"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"when they choose to. Recording defaults to "},{"t":"code","text":"true"},{"t":"text","text":" and starts a session clip"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"automatically at app startup; set it to "},{"t":"code","text":"false"},{"t":"text","text":" to wait until the user clicks"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Record"}]},{"t":"text","text":". In either mode, the user can stop and manually start recording from"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the timeline controls. Events are only captured while a recording clip is active."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"minimal-setup","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Minimal setup"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Register the provider once in the application providers. The default UI then"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"adds a "},{"t":"code","text":"✦ Report"},{"t":"text","text":" launcher in the bottom-right corner and a context menu to"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Craft component hosts. Drag the grip icon beside the launcher to move it out"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"of the way. The launcher stays within the viewport and keeps its position when"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the chat opens and closes. The grip also accepts arrow keys; double-click it to"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"restore the application's default position."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The minimal setup uses the default session recording behavior:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"minimalAiContextProviders"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" [","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"provideSendContextToAi","kind":"function"},{"text":"({}),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"];","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The two entry points are equivalent:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"open the launcher to start with an empty context, then interact with the app;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"right-click a component to start with that component already selected."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The panel contains an instruction, selected elements, and the action timeline."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"The timeline is collapsed initially; use "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Show"}]},{"t":"text","text":" to inspect its events."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Choose "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"+ Select an element"}]},{"t":"text","text":", then click anywhere in the application to add a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"new target without triggering its action or losing the current instruction."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"The cursor changes to a crosshair while the picker is active."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Escape"}]},{"t":"text","text":" or "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Cancel selection"}]},{"t":"text","text":" cancels the picker. Right-clicking a component"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"and choosing "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Add to AI context"}]},{"t":"text","text":" also adds another target to the same draft."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Selected elements can be removed individually."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The two checkboxes control whether to include the action timeline and the full"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"page. The instruction and selected component context are always included."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"what-is-collected","children":[{"t":"text","text":"What is collected"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The session combines several kinds of context:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Selected elements"}]},{"t":"text","text":": tag name, text, outer HTML, and optionally a selector."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Component information"}]},{"t":"text","text":": the host name, Craft host tags, click coordinates,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the clicked element, and truncated host HTML."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Timeline"}]},{"t":"text","text":": DOM interactions, HTTP requests, router activity, primitive"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"activity, and app snapshot reports. HTTP and navigation entries are linked by"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"operation and correlation IDs when those services provide them."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"App snapshots"}]},{"t":"text","text":": the reports emitted by the app snapshot registry while the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"context is being prepared."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"DOM and CSS captures"}]},{"t":"text","text":": the selected component or the full page, including"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"computed styles. These captures are optional because they can be large and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"briefly pause the page while they are collected."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The default prompt contains selected elements, component information, the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"timeline summary, and app snapshots when they exist. "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Include full page"}]},{"t":"text","text":" adds"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the page DOM and computed CSS, excluding the AI overlay itself. It can produce"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"a large prompt. JSON export and replay controls are kept out of this panel."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Clear"}]},{"t":"text","text":" removes the current timeline and, if recording was active, starts a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"fresh clip so the next interactions form a focused reproduction. Clearing keeps"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the instruction and selected targets. A stopped recording stays stopped."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Programmatic session exports and replay APIs remain available for debugging"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"integrations. Use "},{"t":"code","text":"session.exportSessionJson()"},{"t":"text","text":" to obtain a portable session;"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the AI panel's "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Copy prompt"}]},{"t":"text","text":" action produces the context for an assistant."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"match-the-application-s-colours","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Match the application's colours"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Pass partial light and dark palettes with "},{"t":"code","text":"theme"},{"t":"text","text":". Each colour accepts a CSS"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"colour, a CSS variable reference, or a typed Craft style colour token. Unspecified"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"colours keep their defaults; dark values override the light palette for the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"selected colour scheme. By default, the overlay follows the document's"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"data-mode"},{"t":"text","text":" attribute when present, then falls back to the browser preference."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Set "},{"t":"code","text":"colorScheme"},{"t":"text","text":" to "},{"t":"code","text":"system"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"light"},{"t":"text","text":", or "},{"t":"code","text":"dark"},{"t":"text","text":" to choose explicitly. The"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"palette applies to the launcher, context menu, and panel."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"themedAiContextProviders"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"provideSendContextToAi","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  recording: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"true","kind":"keyword"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  theme: {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    light: {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      bg: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'var(--app-surface)'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      text: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'var(--app-text)'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      accent: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'#6d28d9'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"'accent-hover'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'#5b21b6'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"'on-accent'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'#ffffff'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      focus: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'#7c3aed'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    dark: {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      bg: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'#18181b'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      text: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'#fafafa'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      border: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'#71717a'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The most common keys are "},{"t":"code","text":"bg"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"surface"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"surface-muted"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"control-bg"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"text"},{"t":"text","text":","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"text-muted"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"border"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"border-subtle"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"accent"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"accent-hover"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"accent-text"},{"t":"text","text":","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"on-accent"},{"t":"text","text":", and "},{"t":"code","text":"focus"},{"t":"text","text":". "},{"t":"code","text":"SendContextColors"},{"t":"text","text":" exposes all supported colour keys."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"CSS variables can point directly to the application's existing theme, so its"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"colours can change without replacing this provider."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Set "},{"t":"code","text":"launcherLabel"},{"t":"text","text":" to change the default floating button's visible text (the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"small star stays in place):"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"provideSendContextToAi","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  recording: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"false","kind":"keyword"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  launcherLabel: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Share context'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"For a different icon, layout, or behavior, provide a custom launcher component"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"with "},{"t":"code","text":"provideSendContextLauncherComponent"},{"t":"text","text":". The "},{"t":"code","text":"theme"},{"t":"text","text":" palette also applies to"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the built-in launcher."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"send-the-context-to-an-agent","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Send the context to an agent"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Pass a browser-accessible webhook URL to enable the "},{"t":"code","text":"Send"},{"t":"text","text":" action. For example,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the endpoint can create a support ticket or forward the payload to an email"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"service; that server-side integration stays in your application:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"aiContextProviders"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"provideSendContextToAi","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  recording: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"true","kind":"keyword"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  endpoint: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'https://agent.example.com/hooks/context'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  sendButtonLabel: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Send to support'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The browser sends a JSON "},{"t":"code","text":"POST"},{"t":"text","text":" with this versioned shape:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"{","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"\"version\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"1","kind":"number"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"\"prompt\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"# Instruction","kind":"string"},{"text":"\\n","kind":"string"},{"text":"Investigate this screen\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"\"instruction\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"Investigate this screen\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"\"selectedElements\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": [],","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"\"events\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": [],","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"\"snapshot\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": [],","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"\"captures\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": {},","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"\"component\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"\"hostName\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"OrdersPage\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"\"tagList\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": [","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"component:OrdersPage#1\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"],","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"\"coords\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"x\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"120","kind":"number"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"y\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"80","kind":"number"},{"text":" },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"\"outerHTML\"","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"\"<section>…</section>\"","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  }","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"}","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"json","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"prompt"},{"t":"text","text":" is generated from the instruction, the selected options, and the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"structured fields. "},{"t":"code","text":"component"},{"t":"text","text":" is omitted when the chat was opened from the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"launcher without a captured component. "},{"t":"code","text":"captures.page"},{"t":"text","text":" is present when "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Include full page"}]},{"t":"text","text":" is selected."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Unchecking "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Include action timeline"}]},{"t":"text","text":" removes events from both the prompt and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the structured payload. Events generated by the webhook request itself are excluded from"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the context sent to that webhook."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Set "},{"t":"code","text":"sendButtonLabel"},{"t":"text","text":" to match the destination, such as "},{"t":"code","text":"Send to support"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Any "},{"t":"code","text":"2xx"},{"t":"text","text":" response is successful, including "},{"t":"code","text":"200"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"202"},{"t":"text","text":", and "},{"t":"code","text":"204"},{"t":"text","text":". Network"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"failures, timeouts, and non-"},{"t":"code","text":"2xx"},{"t":"text","text":" responses are shown in the chat. "},{"t":"code","text":"Retry"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"reuses the exact same payload. "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Copy prompt"}]},{"t":"text","text":" remains available after a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"failed request."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The endpoint is application configuration shipped to the browser, not a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"secret. It must allow the application's origin through CORS and accept JSON"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"POST"},{"t":"text","text":" requests. Put authentication and secret management in a protected"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"same-origin proxy or agent gateway."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"configure-the-webhook","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Configure the webhook"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"provideSendContextToAi"},{"t":"text","text":" currently accepts the browser-accessible "},{"t":"code","text":"endpoint"},{"t":"text","text":"."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Omit it to keep the experience copy-only, or pass a URL to enable sending:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"customizedAiContextProviders"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"provideSendContextToAi","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  recording: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"true","kind":"keyword"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  endpoint: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'/internal/ai/context'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Treat that URL as public application configuration. Put authentication,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"redaction, and any tenant-specific policy in a protected same-origin proxy or"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"agent gateway; never put credentials in the browser bundle."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The session and its record controller are also injectable:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  SEND_CONTEXT_RECORD_CONTROLLER,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  SEND_CONTEXT_SESSION,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"} ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/component'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { ɵinject ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"as","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" inject } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/core'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"record"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"inject","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"SEND_CONTEXT_RECORD_CONTROLLER"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"record.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"startRecord","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Checkout failure'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"// Later, from the same application flow:","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"record.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"stopRecord","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"summary"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" record.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"exportSummary","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"json"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" record.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"exportJson","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"session"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"inject","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"SEND_CONTEXT_SESSION"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"session.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"capture","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'custom'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'emitted'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  name: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'checkout.validation'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  state: { step: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'payment'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use the record controller for clips and the session for low-level event"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"emission, subscription, clearing, and programmatic export."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"customize-the-ui-with-di","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Customize the UI with DI"}]},{"t"